ble.\\n\\nTo authenticate in a non-interactive environment:\\n  1. Open https://ux.priorlabs.ai in a browser and log in (or register)\\n  2. Accept the license on the Licenses tab\\n  3. Copy your API Key from https://ux.priorlabs.ai/account\\n  4. Set the environment variable: export TABPFN_TOKEN=\"<your-api-key>\"\\n     or in Python (before calling .fit()): import os; os.environ[\"TABPFN_TOKEN\"] = \"<your-api-key>\"']\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":10},{"id":"133149d6-44c9-4542-8e8a-08b04e6b5b2a","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 6b. Real-world drift case study: Electricity (elec2)\n\nChronological train/test split with no synthetic construction — this is genuine concept drift already\npresent in the data (the well-known elec2 benchmark). `severity` here means \"how far forward in time the\ntest window is,\" not an artificial parameter. Runs the same strategies + key baselines on a bounded grid\nto keep compute reasonable; widen `SEVERITIES_CHRONO` / `SEEDS_CHRONO` if time allows.\n","metadata":{}},{"id":"b716d27b-721e-4a66-914c-ab5d33ceec75","cell_type":"code","source":"elec_spec = next(s for s in DATASETS if s.name == \"electricity\")\nSEVERITIES_CHRONO = [0.0, 0.5, 1.0]\nSEEDS_CHRONO = 1 if QUICK_TEST else 3\nCONTEXT_SIZE_CHRONO = 300 if QUICK_TEST else 500\n\nchrono_results = []\n\ntry:\n    X_raw, y = load_dataset(elec_spec)\n    X_proc, _ = preprocess(X_raw)\n\n    for severity in SEVERITIES_CHRONO:\n        for seed in range(SEEDS_CHRONO):\n            run_seed = SEED + seed\n            try:\n                X_train, y_train, X_test, y_test = split_chronological(X_proc, y, severity, seed=run_seed)\n                if len(np.unique(y_train)) < 2 or len(np.unique(y_test)) < 2:\n                    raise ValueError(\"degenerate chronological split\")\n\n                rng = np.random.RandomState(run_seed)\n                n_test = len(X_test)\n                n_unlabeled = max(10, int(n_test * TARGET_UNLABELED_FRACTION))\n                perm = rng.permutation(n_test)\n                X_target_unlabeled = X_test[perm[:n_unlabeled]]\n                X_score, y_score = X_test[perm[n_unlabeled:]], y_test[perm[n_unlabeled:]]\n                if len(np.unique(y_score)) < 2:\n                    raise ValueError(\"degenerate scoring split\")\n\n                _, domain_shift_auc = compute_domain_weights(X_train, X_target_unlabeled, seed=run_seed)\n                common = dict(dataset=\"electricity_chronological\", shift_type=\"temporal_real\",\n                              severity=severity, seed=run_seed, domain_shift_auc=domain_shift_auc)\n\n                for bname, fn in {\n                    \"xgboost_full\": lambda: run_xgb_full(X_train, y_train, X_score),\n                    \"xgboost_importance_weighted\": lambda: run_xgb_importance_weighted(\n                        X_train, y_train, X_score, X_target_unlabeled=X_target_unlabeled, seed=run_seed),\n                }.items():\n                    try:\n                        metrics = score_predictions(y_score, fn())\n                        chrono_results.append({**common, \"strategy\": bname, \"context_size\": len(X_train),\n                                                \"status\": \"ok\", \"error\": None, **metrics})\n                    except Exception as e:\n                        chrono_results.append({**common, \"strategy\": bname, \"context_size\": len(X_train),\n                                                \"status\": \"failed\", \"error\": str(e)})\n\n                for strategy_name, strategy_fn in CONTEXT_STRATEGIES.items():\n                    try:\n                        idx = strategy_fn(X_train, y_train, X_target_unlabeled, CONTEXT_SIZE_CHRONO, seed=run_seed)\n                        X_ctx, y_ctx = X_train[idx], y_train[idx]\n                        if len(np.unique(y_ctx)) < 2:\n                            raise ValueError(\"degenerate context\")\n                        proba = run_tabpfn(X_ctx, y_ctx, X_score)\n                        metrics = score_predictions(y_score, proba)\n                        chrono_results.append({**common, \"strategy\": strategy_name, \"context_size\": CONTEXT_SIZE_CHRONO,\n                                                \"status\": \"ok\", \"error\": None, **metrics})\n                    except Exception as e:\n                        chrono_results.append({**common, \"strategy\": strategy_name, \"context_size\": CONTEXT_SIZE_CHRONO,\n                                                \"status\": \"failed\", \"error\": str(e)})\n\n                print(f\"  electricity chrono severity={severity} seed={run_seed}: done\")\n            except Exception as e:\n                print(f\"  [SKIP] electricity chrono severity={severity} seed={run_seed}: {e}\")\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"[SKIP electricity entirely] {e}\")\n\nchrono_df = pd.DataFrame(chrono_results)\nchrono_df.to_csv(\"results_electricity_chronological.csv\", index=False)\nprint(f\"Saved {len(chrono_df)} rows to results_electricity_chronological.csv\")\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-12T21:11:10.991614Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-12T21:11:10.992149Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-12T21:11:30.218175Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-12T21:11:10.992124Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-12T21:11:30.217415Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"  electricity chrono severity=0.0 seed=42: done\n  electricity chrono severity=0.5 seed=42: done\n  electricity chrono severity=1.0 seed=42: done\nSaved 21 rows to results_electricity_chronological.csv\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":11},{"id":"be8810d4-bc1d-44a9-ad8d-683f22ff402d","cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 7. Results — tables and plots for the paper\n\n- **Table 1**: mean accuracy / ROC-AUC / ECE / Brier per strategy at max synthetic severity — now\n  includes both retraining-style and calibration-style reference points, so the comparison the paper\n  actually needs (